                  %mo +
                  %mi p
                  %mi x
                  %mo +
                  %mi q
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} g(x) \coloneqq a x^3 + p x + q
            is given by
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
