                      %mrow
                        %mi f
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} f
          %p
            In all cases, the partial inverse functions are solutions of the first-order nonlinear
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+differential+equation"} ordinary differential equation
          .maruku-equation
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 3
                  %mi a
                  %msup
                    %mi F
                    %mn 2
                  %mo +
                  %mn 2
                  %mi b
                  %mi F
